{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021074727792-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021094316\"/><p>世運道簡約公屋有女童暈倒。</p><p>今日(21日)早上7時35分，一名女子報案，指其2歲女兒在啟德世運道20號簡約公屋一單位內暈倒。救援人員接報到場，替女童作初步治理後回復清醒，交由救護車送院。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T01:59:51.731726+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:47:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:57:49.425231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T01:57:49.425231+00:00","content_hash":"f3f982acc5206894c588a6e546d4b18d0afb4c68ecf49673ba6ee7af60d8cdea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}